# --- YOUR PERSONAL DATA — never committed or pushed ---
# Your filled-in profile, blocked list, outreach log, metrics, résumés, tracker.
# Templates live in partner-docs/ (tracked); the installer copies them here.
# documents/* (not documents/) so the negation below can re-include one file -- git cannot
# re-include a path whose PARENT DIRECTORY itself is excluded, only a path excluded by a
# same-level pattern.
documents/*
# ...except this one: a TRACKED example (obviously-fake content, never a real record) for
# scripts/build_app_feed.py's build_voice() -- copy-to documents/writing-samples.md to try it.
!documents/writing-samples.example.md

# --- YOUR filled-in config — seeded from scripts/kit_config.example.py by install.sh ---
# Kept OUT of git on purpose: /setup tells you to fill this in, and a TRACKED file you were
# told to edit makes `git pull --ff-only` abort on every future update.
scripts/kit_config.py

# --- build / OS junk ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
*.log
*.aux
*.out
*.tmp
bun.lockb
.DS_Store

# --- compiled Python, regenerated on every import ---
# 138 of these were tracked before 2026-09-12. A .pyc regenerates the moment its module is
# imported, so running the test suite alone dirtied the tree and blocked a history rewrite with
# a confusing message about a file nobody had edited. They also drown git status in noise, which
# invites filtering it out and then reading the filtered view as a clean tree.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- local dev environment — never shipped, carries a home path and local contact names ---
.devcontainer/
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- YOUR live enforcement wiring — created by /setup from .claude/settings.example.json ---
# install.sh's own comment on this file: "git never manages it." True in intent, not yet in
# .gitignore, which is the exact gap that took kit_config.py out of tracking above: a TRACKED
# file the installer refreshes in place makes `git pull --ff-only` abort. Added 2026-09-12
# after checking every local-settings-shaped path an install creates, alongside issue 125.
.claude/settings.json

# Files the PARTNER edits. Tracking any of these recreates the defect that took kit_config.py out of
# tracking: git refuses to overwrite a locally-modified tracked file, so `git pull --ff-only` aborts
# on every future update and the updater misreports it as a network problem. Added 2026-08-03 after
# a `git add -A` was about to track all four.
job_search_tracker.csv
outreach_log.md
prospect_queue.md
bun.lock

# Built app page: generated from the LIVE feed, carries real contacts.
# pii_gate returns 24 blocking findings on it. Never track build output.
app/design/job-attractor-app.html

# rendered activity pages are build output, never source
activities/out/

# --- private test denylist: real names the kit tests check for, never committed ---
tests/.private-denylist.txt

# per-run test temp dirs (tests/run_all.sh), never committed
.test-tmp/

# Send prefill: notes /app prepares for the page, and the prep Claude Code saves for them.
# Per-card, per-person, never tracked (app/design/draft_schema.md).
documents/state/app-drafts/
documents/state/app-prep/
